  "schema:name": "MOFevaluator Materials Database (for Carbon Capture)",
  "schema:description": "A database of experimentally and computationally synthesised Metal Organic Frameworks (MOFs) for carbon capture applications. Data content includes CIF files, chemical compositions, geometric descriptions, and isotherms relating to the adsorption of carbon dioxide, nitrogen and water. The data relates to a variety of carbon dioxide point sources, e.g. coal or natural gas power generation and cement production.",
